{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08696","headline":"苏武 · 李白","name":"苏武","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"苏武在匈奴，十年持汉节。\n白雁上林飞，空传一书札。\n牧羊边地苦，落日归心绝。\n渴饮月窟冰，肌餐天上雪。\n东还沙塞远，北怆河梁别。\n泣把李陵衣，相看泪成血。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08696.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08696","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}